    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR5e0001-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.371" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Thus, correct writings and correct words</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.372" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">are the true root and great efficacy for heaven, earth, the people, and all things.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.373" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">If you wish to greatly clarify and know its trustworthiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.374" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">it is like people praising each other before the ruler with correct writings and correct words.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.375" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The ruler can then be considered greatly intelligent and greatly wise.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.376" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All undertakings will be successful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.377" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">with no loss of correctness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.378" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Those above and below will then obtain the heart and mind of heaven and earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.379" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The three luminaries (sun, moon, and stars) will not lose their movements,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.380" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">the four seasons and five elements will not be disordered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.381" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">the people will all be joyful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.382" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">all saying "Good indeed!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.383" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All things will each obtain their proper place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.384" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Kindness will extend to the gods,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.385" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">then the name will be heard in distant lands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.386" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The multitude of gods will respond with auspicious omens and strange objects will emerge out of joy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.387" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All worthy scholars in the world will gladly come to assist their ruler,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.388" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">not acting secretively.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.389" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Immortals and deities will then bring the methods of immortality and give them to him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.390" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Demons and wicked forces will be annihilated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.391" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The people will be governed accordingly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.392" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">When correct writings and correct words are spoken, there will be no more mutual hatred and malice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.393" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">then grievances and resentments will be eliminated.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.394" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All good in the world will emerge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.395" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">all evil will be hidden.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.396" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The virtuous ruler need only fold his hands and govern himself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.397" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">what worry will there be of danger and destruction?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.398" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">This is the clear proof and efficacy that my correct writings and correct words are the root of goodness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.399" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Is this not a vigorous rectification?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.400" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Does the Perfected One understand?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.401" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Yes, yes.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.402" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">How frightening!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.403" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Seeing the Celestial Master's words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.404" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">I have already greatly awakened,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.405" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and this foolish one knows that the world is already at peace.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.406" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">If the virtuous ruler listens and employs them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.407" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">he will prolong his life."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.408" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Excellent!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.409" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">You can be called a student who understands affairs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.410" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and already fully understands it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.411" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Joyful, joyful!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.412" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Heaven's worries have already been resolved,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.413" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">earth's sickness has already been removed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.414" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">how does the Perfected One know this?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.415" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Indeed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.416" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">all these evils should be seen gone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.417" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and the great sickness of heaven, earth, the people, and all things has already been removed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.418" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Now, it has already been restrained and compared with the correct texts and correct words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.419" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">therefore I know that the great sickness of heaven and earth has already been removed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.420" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Excellent, excellent!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.421" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">You have already □□ understood it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.422" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">If the emperor vigorously practices my words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.423" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and is generous to heaven and earth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.424" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">there will be no more disasters.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.425" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Excellent, excellent!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.426" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">These are important words to the Perfected One.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.427" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">If the ruler of supreme virtue obtains my words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.428" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">heaven will use the law of images to employ officials,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.429" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">from the highest spiritual man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.430" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">down to the smallest and most lowly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.431" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">all these nine men.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.432" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Spirit, Perfected,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
